        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon explicitly preserves the truth boundary for this slice: automation can move repair work and state, but cannot autonomously move requirement truth, auto-promote scenario discoveries, or market itself as a full Automation Closure-Loop.",
